#
# The synthesiser's lines (start-up, songs loaded or refused) go to the log
# server, the program holding the UART, on the interface's io-channel; they are
# written from the caller's Thread during `service` too, so sending never
# waits. An image without the log server leaves it unlinked, and the lines show
# on the semihosting console under QEMU only.
uses log_v1 via component log_server { flush }
